    m_Localized: Nocturne
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466087
    m_Localized: Mort
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915678466129
    m_Localized: "Dragon\u2019s Blessing"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915691048991
    m_Localized: "Dragon Scale \xB7 Defiance"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915691048992
    m_Localized: At the start of Turn 1, gain {ValueRate1} Ward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915691048993
    m_Localized: "Dragon Scale \xB7 Fury"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915691048994
    m_Localized: When healed beyond maximum HP, gain Armor equal to the excess healing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915691048995
    m_Localized: "Dragon Scale \xB7 Guardian"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915691048996
    m_Localized: At the start of your turn, if you have at least {ValueRate1} Armor,
      gain 1 Smite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915691048997
    m_Localized: "Dragon Scale \xB7 Tremor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915691048998
    m_Localized: At the start of each turn, lose 3 HP and gain {ValueRate1} Boost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915691048999
    m_Localized: "Dragon Scale \xB7 Fierce Strike"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915691049000
    m_Localized: Deal {ValueRate1}% more damage while at 50% HP or less.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915691049001
    m_Localized: "Swordheart \xB7 Keen Edge"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631872
    m_Localized: The first Attack Memory you queue each battle hits {ValueRate1}
      additional time(s).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631873
    m_Localized: "Swordheart \xB7 Pinnacle"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631874
    m_Localized: After the final attack, deal piercing damage based on the number
      of attacks queued consecutively.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631875
    m_Localized: "Swordheart \xB7 Flowing Blades"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631876
    m_Localized: Memories that hit at least {CountRate1} times deal {ValueRate1}
      additional damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631877
    m_Localized: "Swordheart \xB7 Flash"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631878
    m_Localized: When piercing damage hits, inflict {ValueRate1} Bleed on the target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631879
    m_Localized: "Swordheart \xB7 Gale"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631880
    m_Localized: If only one enemy is targeted, deal {ValueRate1} additional damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631881
    m_Localized: "Ember \xB7 Ignition"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631882
    m_Localized: At the start of Turn 1, inflict {ValueRate1} Weakness on all enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631883
    m_Localized: "Ember \xB7 Warmth"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631884
    m_Localized: When applying a buff or debuff, gain Armor equal to the amount actually
      applied.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631885
    m_Localized: "Ember \xB7 Radiance"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631886
    m_Localized: Apply {ValueRate1} additional stacks of buffs to adjacent allies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631887
    m_Localized: "Ember \xB7 Resolve"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631888
    m_Localized: When inflicting a debuff on an enemy, also inflict {ValueRate1}
      Poison.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631889
    m_Localized: "Ember \xB7 Spread"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631890
    m_Localized: If you end your turn with 0 Mana, the first Memory you queue next
      turn costs 0 Mana.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631891
    m_Localized: "Grace \xB7 Devotion"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631892
    m_Localized: At the start of each turn, grant {ValueRate1} Regeneration to adjacent
      allies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631893
    m_Localized: "Grace \xB7 Protection"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631894
    m_Localized: Gain {ValueRate1} Karma for each enemy defeated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631895
    m_Localized: "Grace \xB7 Salvation"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631896
    m_Localized: When healed at 75% HP or higher, reduce the oldest debuff by {ValueRate1}
      stack(s).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631897
    m_Localized: "Grace \xB7 Judgment"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631898
    m_Localized: When you attack, Vulnerability increases damage taken by {ValueRate1}%
      instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631899
    m_Localized: "Grace \xB7 Dedication"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631900
    m_Localized: When Karma reaches its maximum, inflict {ValueRate1} Vulnerability
      on all enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631901
    m_Localized: "Liberation \xB7 Thirst"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631902
    m_Localized: Restore {ValueRate1} Karma at the start of an expedition.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631903
    m_Localized: "Liberation \xB7 Passion"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631904
    m_Localized: When Karma reaches its maximum, gain {ValueRate1} Armor next turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631905
    m_Localized: "Liberation \xB7 Reaper"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631906
    m_Localized: Death Scythe deals {ValueRate1} additional damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631907
    m_Localized: "Liberation \xB7 Blood Blossom"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631908
    m_Localized: Scarlet Nova deals {ValueRate1} additional damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631909
    m_Localized: "Liberation \xB7 Crescent"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631910
    m_Localized: Crimson Chain and Crescent Swing deal {ValueRate1} additional damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631911
    m_Localized: "Engraving \xB7 Unstable Source"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631912
    m_Localized: Decrease maximum HP by {ValueRate1}, but increase maximum Mana by
      {ValueRate2}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631913
    m_Localized: "Engraving \xB7 Withered Pulse"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631914
    m_Localized: Decrease maximum HP by {ValueRate1}, but increase Mana Regen by
      {ValueRate2}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631915
    m_Localized: "Engraving \xB7 Hardened Flesh"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631916
    m_Localized: Decrease maximum Mana by {ValueRate1}, but increase maximum HP by
      {ValueRate2}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631917
    m_Localized: "Engraving \xB7 Lost Breath"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631918
    m_Localized: Decrease maximum HP by {ValueRate1}, but restore {ValueRate2} HP
      after each battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631919
    m_Localized: "Engraving \xB7 Twisted Torrent"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631920
    m_Localized: Decrease maximum Mana by {ValueRate1}, but increase Mana Regen by
      {ValueRate2}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631921
    m_Localized: Overflowing Vitality
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41385915703631922
    m_Localized: Increase maximum HP by {ValueRate1}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
