  - m_Id: 31275309844373570
    m_Localized: Press End Turn or Space to finish queuing actions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31275309844373565
    m_Localized: Click a mutant to inspect its information.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31275309844373566
    m_Localized: Click Move or press A to select movement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31275309844373567
    m_Localized: Click a grid tile to move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31275309844373568
    m_Localized: Click Attack or press Q to queue an attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31275309844373569
    m_Localized: Queued actions appear on the timeline.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31275309844373573
    m_Localized: Press End Turn or Space to finish queuing actions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31275309844373571
    m_Localized: You can queue the same attack multiple times. Queue it twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31275309844373572
    m_Localized: Queue the same attack once more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31275482117021698
    m_Localized: Please gather the materials we need for our research there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31275482117021696
    m_Localized: Used well, this will be a great help on your future expeditions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31275482117021697
    m_Localized: Once you're ready, come speak to me again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
